flowchart LR
  A[User clicks<br/>Run in background] --> B[POST /api/jobs]
  B --> C[(Job record saved<br/>status = queued)]
  B --> D[[Redis queue]]
  D --> E[Celery worker]
  E --> F[Fetch data<br/>progress 10%]
  F --> G{Provider error?}
  G -- yes --> H[status = retrying<br/>wait 2s, 4s, 8s<br/>max 3 retries]
  H --> E
  G -- no --> I[Run script in sandbox<br/>progress 40%]
  I --> J[Save result<br/>progress 100%]
  J --> K[Analyses page polls<br/>and shows result]
  G -- bad input --> L[status = failed<br/>no retry]
